Package: dethumb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Thumbnailer for Linux .desktop files and Windows .exe binaries
 dethumb generates PNG thumbnails for Linux .desktop files and Windows .exe
 binaries, integrating with file managers via the freedesktop thumbnailer
 protocol. Desktop entries are rendered from their Icon= entry using the system
 icon theme; executables have their embedded icon extracted from PE resources.
